      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does this remove the need for host_ref_dt or do we need to keep it around for back-compat? If we keep it around for backcompat, how do we ensure DT doesn\u0027t have duplicate values.\n\n https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Virtualization/android/virtmgr/src/aidl.rs;l\u003d854-855?q\u003dtrusted_props\u0026ss\u003dh%2Fgoogleplex-android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%2F%2B%2Frefs%2Fheads%2Fmain:packages%2Fmodules%2FVirtualization%2Fandroid%2F",
      "revId": "8082ff5611885fac7c278a988e96358623da9fab",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
