      "side": 1,
      "message": "SecretkeeperProxy is really a RPC binder service for PVM (It is called by MicrodroidManager). PVMs do not \u0026 must not (for security reason) rely on `getSecretKeeperIdentity`. So it would be good to return Err::Unimplemented on this SecretkeeperProxy!",
